896 0 obj
  << /ActualText (EXPERIENCE \n\nCapstone Leader \nGeoport Malaybalay Leading development of a community geo tagging mobile app for reporting highway issues\056\n\nUI\046UX Designer Freelance\nDesigned user centered web and mobile interfaces\054 focusing on usability\054 accessibility\054 and visual consistency while collaborating with clients to deliver engaging digital experiences\056\n\nAI Video Annotator\nAnnotated and labeled video datasets to support AI and machine learning training\056 Maintained high accuracy in object tracking\054 activity labeling\054 and data validation while following strict annotation and quality standards\056\n\nUI\057UX Designer Intern\nSupported UI\057UX related tasks by applying design principles and user\055centered thinking in real\055world projects\056 Strengthened problem\055solving skills and attention to detail while contributing to the overall improvement of digital experiences\056\n\nAcademic Mentoring Secretary\nServed as the Academic Mentoring Secretary of the Bukidnon State University Computer Society\054 coordinating mentoring activities\054 managing documentation\054 and facilitating communication between mentors and students\056\n\nSocial Media Officer\nServed as the Social Media Officer of the Bukidnon State University Computer Society\054 handling content creation and social media engagement\056)
